// Time:  O(n + n * (log10(9k)/k) + ... + k)
//      = O((n - (log10(9k)/k)*k)/(1-log10(9k)/k))
//      = O(n / (1-log10(9k)/k)) = O(n) for k >= 2
// Space: O(n)

